# Secrets for `npx wrangler dev`: copy to .dev.vars (ignored by git) and fill in.
# Deployed Workers take them from `npx wrangler secret put NAME` instead.
# The GitHub OAuth app's client secret. For local runs, use a second OAuth app whose callback
# URL is http://localhost:8787/license, and override GITHUB_CLIENT_ID here.
GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=
# A classic token of an owner of the SPONSORABLE organization with read:org and read:user,
# for renewals: it lists the organization's sponsors, private ones included.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
# PKCS#8 PEM from keygen.sh, on one line with \n for line breaks.
LICENSE_PRIVATE_KEY=
